<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean securities union body calls for strikes.</title>
<headline>S.Korean securities union body calls for strikes.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A union body representing securities industry workers on Monday called on its members to join a nationwide strike from Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Korean Securities Trade Union Association, under the umbrella of the outlawed Korean Confederation of Trade Unions, urged members to walk out from 1.00 p.m. (0400 GMT).</p>
</text>
